{"type":"message","id":"31100050","parentId":"7832eceb","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:04:49.853Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I created the CSS file. Now I need to run Marp CLI to convert the markdown to PDF using that theme and size 1000x1200. I'll execute: marp --pdf --theme openclaw-for-beginners-theme.css --size 1000x1200 openclaw-for-beginners.md -o openclaw-for-beginners-graphic.pdf\n\nBut I need to be careful: the markdown file already exists. The output file should be placed in the same folder. I'll specify -o with the full output path.\n\nLet me run the command.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll generate the PDF with Marp:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_59e44c82866b485a9b45d7a4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"powershell -NoProfile -Command \"marp --pdf --theme openclaw-for-beginners-theme.css --size 1000x1200 'C:\\Users\\mangs\\Desktop\\Content Marketing\\automated_content\\openclaw-for-beginners.md' -o 'C:\\Users\\mangs\\Desktop\\Content Marketing\\automated_content\\openclaw-for-beginners-graphic.pdf'\"","pty":true,"timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":23452,"output":381,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23833,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771416282510}}
